# Test repo carries only test cases and case docs (rule 2026-11-23).
# feat112/: whitelist only what the tests read at run time plus its provenance;
# all other working docs (reviews, drafts, guides, issue records) stay local.
feat112/*
!feat112/README.md
!feat112/FEAT-112-task-degradation-gate-testplan.md
!feat112/testplan-revision-20261112.revised.md
!feat112/expectation-fingerprints.txt
!feat112/baseline-05af9cc3/
!feat112/tools/
# Dev-handoff jar bundles and notes stay local
feat058-jars/
feat033-jars/
feat057-jars/
# Issue drafts are tracked as issues in the gitcode repos; local originals only
docs/issues/
